The layout app/layouts/panorama.json is derived from Herdr app's shipped
layouts/main.json, installed on 2026-11-03. Changes use panorama-owned agents, Spaces, tabs and pane-header mods, keep the
sidebar at 320 logical pixels, and size Spaces from its rendered stock rows so
the agent list receives the remaining column space.

Herdr app is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
See LICENSE.herdr-app in this directory. No artwork is copied; the layout
continues to reference the app's own shipped mods and assets.

The sidebar adapts Herdr app's shipped agents/main.js patterns for priority
sections, row/fold/pin interactions, status marks, icons, age and native tree
lines; those derived portions retain the same Apache-2.0 attribution.
Original panorama feed/tree logic and installer code use the repository MIT
license. The panorama-spaces/main.js, panorama-tabs/main.js and panorama-pane/main.js
mods are clones of Herdr app 0.1.12's shipped spaces, tabs and pane mods. They
retain the stock git/machine/worktree/recovery, tab/panel/window controls and
terminal header behavior, adding only the Panorama data/count/navigation and
Swarm-specific glyph/header branches. Their Apache-2.0 license text is included
inside each cloned mod directory. Shipped icon/assets are referenced by path;
no artwork is copied. No shipped files are edited.

